  LVGL (https://lvgl.io): MIT.
  ArduinoJson (https://arduinojson.org): MIT.
  pngle (https://github.com/kikuchan/pngle): MIT.
  JPEGDEC (https://github.com/bitbank2/JPEGDEC): Apache-2.0.
